ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507848995_883418857648989_7185541961801055040_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gk6z4wr7BP0Q7kNvwGP2B6Y&_nc_oc=Adr6Qvz8zXbrNW0sVxyAc_iMVZchJm60C1ZbaUd85WtTaTb8wNVneG9DQDGdchoFqCw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ3yyu_G2_R8gTeNkC4CJ3rE08Ah76dxVKRoBRteqEh7A&oe=6AAA98F3"}, "display_name": "BuildPort Xumia", "keywords": ["social", "sandbox", "crafting", "pvp", "battle"], "long_description": "Epic space battles start with ships and weapons you build \ud83d\ude80\ud83d\udca5\ud83e\udd47\n\nBuildPort Xumia is a physics based social combat sandbox where creativity and skill shape every battle.\n\nBuild your own spaceships and hand weapons, pilot them into combat, battle on foot, defend against waves of enemies, or challenge other players in PvP. Every creation is yours, and every match is different.\n\n- Build unique spaceships and hand weapons\n- Battle in PvP, Co-op, and Core Siege\n- Fly through the Rift and master your skills\n- Build with friends in Social BuildPort\n- Climb the leaderboards and prove yourself\n\nEvery build is unique. Every victory is earned. \n\n{1836199927060120}\n\nBuild. Battle. Go Solo or Team up.\n\nWhether you enjoy creating, competing, or simply hanging out with friends, BuildPort Xumia gives you the freedom to play your own way.\n\n{2003865910342450}\n\nNEW Update: Level Up!\n\nThe biggest update yet brings progression, customization, smoother movement, and even more ways to play together.\n\n**Progression System**\n\n- Complete quests and earn XP\n- Unlock new rewards as you level up\n- Keep progressing every time you play\n\nExpanded Customization\n\n- Unlock color palettes\n- Customize your ships and hand weapons\n- Show off your own style\n\n{2251075935670371}\n\nMore Ways to Play\n\n- Auto Match is back, making it easier to jump into multiplayer\n- New hybrid movement with smooth continuous locomotion\n- Hand gizmos can now eliminate other players in multiplayer\n- Throw fun objects at your friends for even more chaos\n\nCreate. Fight. Level Up.", "short_description": "Epic space battles start with ships and weapons you build \ud83d\ude80\ud83d\udca5\ud83e\udd47\n\nBuild your own spaceship, then battle other players for it. BuildPort Xumia is a VR sandbox where you design \n\n- Build spaceships and hand held weapons your way\n- Battle against others in PvP and Co-op modes\n- Complete quests, level up, and unlock colors and rewards\n- Enjoy Auto Match, hybrid movement, throwables, and multiplayer hand combat\n\nEvery match is different and every build is uniquely yours.\n\nBuild. Battle. Level Up."}]}, "developer_name": "Yumebau Inc.", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://buildport.xumia.io/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://buildport.xumia.io/terms-of-use", "publisher_name": "Yumebau Inc.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://buildport.xumia.io/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "29033274706272308"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619602_1577651650543222_7930702316270002868_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=59C2PbwQBHYQ7kNvwH